# Constants Synchronization System

## Overview
This rule documents the critical constants synchronization system in Juno that maintains consistency between Rust backend and TypeScript frontend constants, preventing action name mismatches and build failures.

## Architecture Overview

### Single Source of Truth: Rust Constants
All constants originate from Rust files in [src-tauri/src/constants/](mdc:src-tauri/src/constants/):

```rust
// src-tauri/src/constants/agent.rs
pub const ACTION_LEFT_CLICK: &str = "left_click";
pub const ACTION_RIGHT_CLICK: &str = "right_click";
pub const ACTION_MOUSE_MOVE: &str = "mouse_move";
```

### Auto-Generated TypeScript: [src/lib/constants.generated.ts](mdc:src/lib/constants.generated.ts)
**NEVER EDIT MANUALLY** - This file is auto-generated:

```typescript
// This file is auto-generated from Rust constants
// Run `npm run generate-constants` to regenerate

export const AGENT_ACTIONS = {
    LEFT_CLICK: "left_click",
    RIGHT_CLICK: "right_click", 
    MOUSE_MOVE: "mouse_move",
    // ... 243 total constants
} as const;
```

### Frontend-Only Constants: [src/lib/constants.ts](mdc:src/lib/constants.ts)
Frontend-specific constants that don't need Rust equivalents:

```typescript
// Re-export generated constants for convenience
export * from './constants.generated';

export const UI_CONSTANTS = {
    SCROLL_THRESHOLD: 100,
    ANIMATION_DURATION_MS: 200,
} as const;
```

## Generation Process

### Build Script: [scripts/generate-ts-constants.js](mdc:scripts/generate-ts-constants.js)
Extracts constants from Rust files and generates TypeScript:

```javascript
// Scans these Rust files
const rustFiles = [
    'src-tauri/src/constants/agent.rs',
    'src-tauri/src/constants/events.rs',
    'src-tauri/src/constants/http.rs',
];

// Generates typed TypeScript with proper categorization
generateTypedConstants(extractedConstants, outputPath);
```

### Automatic Generation via NPM Scripts
Constants are generated automatically during build:

```json
{
    "scripts": {
        "generate-constants": "node scripts/generate-ts-constants.js",
        "prebuild": "npm run generate-constants",
        "build": "tsc && vite build"
    }
}
```

**CRITICAL**: Constants generation runs before every build to ensure synchronization.

## Constants File Organization

### Rust Constants Structure
```
src-tauri/src/constants/
├── mod.rs              # Module exports and re-exports
├── agent.rs            # Agent actions and configuration  
├── events.rs           # Tauri event names
├── http.rs             # HTTP status codes
└── ui.rs               # UI-related constants
```

